  },
  {
   "text": "Let's cross over to the other side, he said when evening fell",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 17.89,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We left the crowd along the shore and rode into the swell",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 15.47,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The sky went black, the squall came down, the water filled the hull",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 14.29,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And Jesus in the stern was sleeping on a cushion through it all",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 15.53,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Teacher, don't you care that we're going to drown?",
